title: Global shell › Demo menu › Reset demo data
route: Every page (Demo menu › Reset demo data)
intro: One click puts every part of the demo back to its starting point and lands on the Dashboard. Use it between run-throughs. There is no confirmation step.
dir: TD
also: Not reset: the Ask FLO chat, the Authorizations group's open or closed state and the worklist's last view (they live in the page). Anything done before a browser reload is gone anyway, because the demo keeps nothing between reloads.
---
start s1 "Open the Demo menu"
click c1 "Click 'Reset demo data' (red text, below the divider)"
process p1 "The demo data is replaced by its starting copy, all at once"

group gR "What goes back to the start"
  store r1 "Clock: Tue 20 Oct 2026, 10:42 am\n('Demo' pill reads 'Tue 10:42 am')"
  store r2 "Dashboard: all requests and denials, and all filters"
  store r3 "Notifications: the original six, four unread. Open toasts are cleared"
  store r4 "Authorizations: answers, applied actions, dismissals, draft edits"
  store r5 "New Case: the five drafts in progress, '4 sent today', referrals, referral badge"
  store r6 "Eligibility & Benefits, Denial Intelligence, Payers, EMR Connect: all work done in them"
  store r9 "Settings: every agent back at its starting level, every switch on, no pause"
  store r10 "Viewing as: Jordan Perez, UR coordinator, on Both sites\n(the site switch and the user card follow)"
  store r7 "Authorizations: the approved authorizations, accepted denials and the 47 reviews of the week. Signed reviews are unsigned, updates added are removed"
  store r8 "Next denial number starts again at D-3319"
endgroup

process p2 "Menu closes"
process p3 "App goes to /dashboard\n(even when already there, and from any other page)"
toast t1 "'Demo data reset'\n'Everything is back to the starting point.'"
process p4 "Sidebar badges return to their starting numbers\n3, 19, 4, 9, 8, 3"
process p5 "Page-only state is lost as the page changes: open drawers, typed text"
process p7 "Not reset either: the sidebar group stays open or closed as it was, and Authorizations still reopens on its last view and filters"
process p6 "Ask FLO chat stays: reset does not touch it"
end e1 "Demo is at its first screen again"

s1 --> c1 --> p1
p1 --> r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 & r5 & r6 & r7 & r8 & r9 & r10
r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 & r5 & r6 & r7 & r8 & r9 & r10 --> p2
p2 --> p3 --> t1 --> p4 --> p5 --> p6 --> p7 --> e1
